"""Part 8e-ii mutations: the human effects (the command map's tactical camera).

Run with the camera build: --build build_camera.bat --check check_camera.py (CAMERA_TEST; the
checks in tactical_test.inc).

Equivalent (left alive, by design):
  C 518 num / arith    |square - 1| < 1e-8 holds only for a square of exactly 1, whose length is
                       1 either way.
  C 567 del            the flight's end rotation copied before SetDir, which sets all of it.
  C 645 del            ResetHumans(true) on the way on does nothing.
  C 720 cmp, 722 cmp   the transparency at 2.4 and 0.4 squared metres: the line gives 0 and 1
                       there too.
  C 803 cmp            the sum at exactly -89 degrees: the limit's angle is the angle asked (up to
                       rounding).
  C 823 arith          the drag's sum with -y^2: 0 only when the move's parts cancel exactly.
  C 847 cmp            1 < done or 1 <= done: the same at 1.
"""
